      "id": 204435,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-09-21T12:29:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>With Legacy of Destruction I imagine a case where Joseph Parsons either worked for the British from the onset or betrayed Paul Revere. &nbsp;As time went on the USSR and its allies fought against the oppressive British kingdom. &nbsp;Eventually they beaten due to the aid of the Legact of Destruction, whom I assume their first name remains the same through generations but is no longer Paul, and areas like Mordengrad are under heavy watch. &nbsp; Eventually an inventor named&nbsp;<span>Fyodor was born and brought Mordengrad into some prominence. &nbsp;However, he did not want to use his inventions on his own people and the current Legacy of Destruction was brought in to take him down. &nbsp; His daughter, Ivana, had idolized her father and was just as brilliant so she took up creating inventions in secret to stop the Legacy of Destruction to allow her people the freedom they deserve. &nbsp;</span></p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:33:34.474Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
      "reads": 2,
      "readers_count": 1,
      "score": 5.4,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 17187,
      "topic_slug": "speculation-on-alternate-universe-backstories",
      "display_username": "Sonvar",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>With Legacy of Destruction I imagine a case where Joseph Parsons either worked for the British from the onset or betrayed Paul Revere. &nbsp;As time went on the USSR and its allies fought against the oppressive British kingdom. &nbsp;Eventually they beaten due to the aid of the Legact of Destruction, whom I assume their first name remains the same through generations but is no longer Paul, and areas like Mordengrad are under heavy watch. &nbsp; Eventually an inventor named&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(37, 37, 37); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Fyodor was born and brought Mordengrad into some prominence. &nbsp;However, he did not want to use his inventions on his own people and the current Legacy of Destruction was brought in to take him down. &nbsp; His daughter, Ivana, had idolized her father and was just as brilliant so she took up creating inventions in secret to stop the Legacy of Destruction to allow her people the freedom they deserve. &nbsp;</span></p>",
